  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-素材管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\"],\"capability_summary\":\"通过此接口，用户可以对素材视频进行批量删除。当素材删除失败时，会展示在video_id列表，不在此列表内的素材表示删除成功。关键配合接口为获取Access token接口和附录-返回码文档\",\"id\":\"qianchuan.file_video.delete\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/file/video/delete/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1763394567366656\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先通过此接口获取授权access_token才能调用批量删除视频素材接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"批量删除视频素材接口的应答字段中返回码和返回信息的详细说明需要参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1763394567366656\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"批量删除视频素材\"}",
